  m_text: "\uC81C\uC791\n    \uBE45\uB370\uC774\uD130 20215243 \uC815\uC900\uC6A9,
    \uCF58\uD150\uCE20IT 20235221 \uC774\uAC15\uCC2C\n\nMUSIC\n    Original music
    created with Suno AI\n\nSOUND EFFECTS\n    \"Creepy Laugh - 2\" by DRAGON-STUDIO\n   
    \"giggle10\" by Reitanna (freesound_community)\n    \"quick giggle\" by Reitanna
    (freesound_community)\n    \"Beep warning\" by freesound_community\n    \"Traditional
    Stamp\" by I.fekry (freesound_community)\n    via Pixabay \u2014 Pixabay Content
    License\n\n    CB Sounddesign / APPlicable Sounds\n    Epic Stock Media\n   
    via Sonniss #GameAudioGDC Bundle\n\n    \"SCI-FI_DOOR_2\" by alexo400 (modified)\n   
    via Freesound \u2014 CC0 1.0\n\nART & VISUAL EFFECTS\n    Poly Halloween Pack
    by polyperfect\n    Hyper Casual FX Pack Vol.1 by Kyeoms\n    Free emojis pixel
    art by Arlan Trindade\n    Colorful UI Kit by Smashy Tech\n    School assets
    by A.R.S|T.\n    via Unity Asset Store\n\n    Emoji artwork by EmojiOne\n   
    Licensed under CC BY 4.0\n    creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0\n\n    Some
    doll textures were created with generative AI (ChatGPT, OpenAI)\n\nFONTS\n   
    \uCE74\uD39824 PRO \uC2AC\uB9BC \uB9E5\uC2A4 \u2014 \uCE74\uD39824\n    \uBA54\uC774\uD50C\uC2A4\uD1A0\uB9AC
    \uC11C\uCCB4 \u2014 NEXON Korea\n    Liberation Sans \u2014 Red Hat, SIL Open
    Font License 1.1"
